    "UX round 3 item 5: the own time-pressure rating is required (no skip); the server refuses pressure_skip.",
    "FR-1 feature flag: structured requests plus natural language (the pre-round-3 behavior).",
    "Re-issued to bind fallback_bank v3 (O-1/O-3 2026-10-03): adds the asks_intel_nl typed-ask pool for nl_only and the fixed identity_probe disclosure lines. No other field changes.",
    "UX round 4 (UX_Feedback_v4, 2026-10-05): re-issued to bind requests.demo@v2 (varied scripted-request phrasing), fallbacks.neutral@v4 (diversified social-reply pool), and post_task.tp_demo@v2 (pre-debrief teammate-nature choice item).",
    "Approved for live fielding (2026-10-06): D01 (field tp_review_first), D02 (pressure values high [6,7] / low [2,3]), D04 ($4.00 base, technical_stop=base_paid), D06 (instrument copy), D07 (teammate policy), D10 (timing) resolved per PI direction; main-campus IRB confirmed blanket protocol coverage, no amendment required.",
    "Reference-status artifacts bind as-is (reference = verbatim approved material); the two proposed_unapproved bindings re-issue as approved versions (fallbacks.neutral@v5, payment.s5_base_only@v2) — see each artifact's approval note."
